abstract: >-
  An interactive algebraic geometry companion covering degree of a surface,
  projection from a point on the Clebsch cubic, 27 lines, 28 bitangents,
  and special projection configurations. Based on Salvatore Floccari's
  Algebraic Surfaces and K3 Surfaces course, Winter Semester 2025/26.
keywords:
  - algebraic geometry
  - cubic surfaces
  - blow-up
  - 27 lines
  - 28 bitangents
  - interactive mathematics
